  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "According to the docs/tooltip:\n\n\"Friend requests will be auto-declined, user images and thumbnails will be disabled, and your location will be hidden\"\n\nAccording to the patch notes  (https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202115):\n\n\"New friend requests and friend requests received in the 5 minutes before activating Streamer Mode are automatically declined...\"\n\nI don't think this is accurate, streamer mode does not decline incoming friend requests, it just ignores them.\n\nWhen I run vrchat with streamer mode on, notifications still pile up on \"https://vrchat.com/home/messages\", just under the \"ignored\" line.\n\nUnintended bug? If not, at least the description is inaccurate.",
